      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Every runner has legitimate claims in a tough one for punters. NO NO YES (4) ran a nice race first-up at the Illawarra Grange then went back in trip and was less effective last time at Scone. Nicely placed now stepping up to the mile at the third run back. Big chance from a favourable gate. ALABAMA SHOWDOWN (2) filled a quinella hole at the first four outings this prep, all at provincial and country level. Fair effort last time over 1300m at Randwick, making some late ground. New to this distance but should give a good account. OKAMI STAR (8) looked a chance but found one better in the closing stages over this trip at Gosford last start. Rarely wins but is worth an each-way ticket. FEDERAL RESERVE (1) is twice a winner at the mile and must come under consideration.",
